        </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-6 span-6\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/8ee7cacd-d8be-49ea-bb38-3c1060a598ad_949/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/8ee7cacd-d8be-49ea-bb38-3c1060a598ad_949/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e\" id=\"block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Chad is a Co-Founder and Managing Partner at Peak Technology Partners. Chad has been advising technology companies on financing and strategic transactions for over twenty years. Chad has executed over $90 billion of transactions over his career.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Prior to co-founding PEAK in 2016, Chad was a Senior Director of Finance at Sojern, a travel technology company, responsible for corporate development and FP&amp;A. &nbsp;Prior to Sojern, Chad was a Senior Director of Investment Banking at Arbor Advisors where he advised technology entrepreneurs on M&amp;A and capital raising transactions. Chad began his investment banking career at Lehman Brothers / Barclays Capital in New York City, executing a number of high-profile transactions during his nine years at the firm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Chad also has startup experience, having founded SmartFunded, an online fundraising platform for public schools.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Chad holds an MBA from the Kellogg School of Management and a B.S. in Chemical Engineering from the University of Utah.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>\u200bChad is a Registered Representative of Finalis Securities LLC Member </em><a href=\"https://www.finra.org\"><em>FINRA</em></a><em> / </em><a href=\"https://www.sipc.org\"><em>SIPC</em></a><em>.</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-2c7ace979e9667c8ea4e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
 "excerpt": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Chad is a Managing Partner at Peak Technology Partners. Chad has been advising technology companies on financing and strategic transactions for over twenty years.</p>",
